{"availability":"available","full":"steventheworker/DockAltTab","name":"DockAltTab","description":"Window preview app for MacOS (on the dock) using AltTab.","category":"Other","language":"Swift","stars":112,"forks":5,"created":"2021-09-21T20:38:54Z","updated":"2026-10-05T07:59:51Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://DockAltTab.netlify.app","topics":["alt-tab","alttab","app","dock","foss","macos","previewing","previews","swift","window"],"demo":"https://dockalttab.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:33:57.493Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:33:57.493Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:33:57.493Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T21:08:10.647Z","stars":112,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:33:57.493Z","stars":112,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Window previews for the macOS Dock, built directly on top of AltTab.","Hover a Dock icon and its windows pop up right above it; the AltTab switcher (⌥⇥ by default) is still there too.","This used to be two apps: a DockAltTab companion that drove a \"scriptable\" fork of AltTab through AppleScript. This repository merges them — the DockAltTab behaviour now lives inside the AltTab codebase (see src/DockAltTab), so there is no companion app and no AppleScript round-trip. Everything AltTab does (the switcher, the settings window, Sparkle updates, …) is still included."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/steventheworker/DockAltTab/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9814156dc119918c7ef7a507f64b50c921b63cff02e0292ae553292821229981","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:10.798Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:10.798Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Window previews for the macOS Dock, built directly on top of AltTab.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/steventheworker/DockAltTab/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9814156dc119918c7ef7a507f64b50c921b63cff02e0292